      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My content cache is at 29.99 GB, and I have not crashed at all. So the issue doesn't seem to be globally affecting everyone. It could be an issue with your specific computer?\n\nIf this really is a cache issue, you can slow down the rate at which your cache is filled, by changing your Avatar Optimization settings to \"0 MB Maximum Download Size\". Doing this will make all avatars appear as an impostor for you, which is only 1 MB each. Then you can just enable avatars of people you want to see.",
