      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A week ago or so I clicked on My Worlds on my menu and selected my main world. It started to load, displayed the image of the world I was in (my home world) and just reloaded that one.\n\nI pushed out new versions for Android and Windows and I could then start an instance of my world. The following day the exact same thing happened. Again I pushed the same version out one more time and again I could create an instance.\n\nI'm guessing it has something to do with the world id. I've just pushed out the same world with a new id and we will see what happens.",
