      "value": "@{66bb3ee63ea89e011c428731|full_name} I realize we can't be told of every detail of every patch but is there some indication of what was done to attempt a \"fix\"? If this behavior was not happening before (and it wasn't) and it happens for me every day it seems obvious that something broke the system.\n\nThe problem is that I have no idea if attempting to use Build 1662 will fix my issue. I don't know if it affects anything else. Is it schedule for release soon?\n\nI very much doubt that what I'm encountering is related to any cache issue which is why I am reluctant to go through the effort.",
