      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm shocked but have to say not surprised that an error of this magnitude is only \"tracked\". I tried a few more things (obviously a user has limited means to test workarounds) and despite numerous attempts have concluded that my worlds will simply not be visitable any longer.\n\nIf I click on the world icon and it displays the wrong world icon and it reloads the world I am already in what is it that VRC developers think we should do?\n\nI'm guessing give up with that and then buy VRC+ or some trinket. That will as of now never happen. What a way to run a company.",
