      "value": "@{67abe46b592c3fc68cc3b843|full_name} Appreciate the reply but does that mean the \"fix\" fixes the cause of my issue? Do I create another ticket? Is that one going to be ignored, tracked? Do keep in mind that nothing has changed on my end except that I can no longer join my own worlds.\n\nI have suggested that it might be corruption in the DB that holds world information. Obviously I cannot test that I can only speculate.\n\nI update my worlds. I enter them. The following day only 1 of 3 (the home world) works. Any attempt to enter the others displays \"loading\" my homeworld image and I'm back where I started.\n\nUpdate my worlds and the cycle starts again.\n\nCould this in any way be something I am causing? It seems very unlikely considering what I see happening.\n\nDid you clear the cache? Yes. Did you create a new world? Yes. Did you reboot everything? Yes.\n\nI could create a new account does VRChat support think that is worthwhile trying? Do you see there is little \"support\" in support?",
